{"strongs": "H0529", "word": "אֵמֻן", "translit": "e.mun", "root": "אמם", "morph": "H:N-M", "pos": "noun [masculine]", "gloss": "trusting, faithfulness", "definition": "אֵמֻן noun [masculine] trusting, faithfulness (on formation compare Ges «GKC:84a»§ 84a R. 12). 1. 1. בָּנִים לֹא אֵמֻן בָּם children in whom there is no trusting Deut 32:20 (poetry) 2. אֱמוּנִים plural abstract faithfulness ; ׳ צִיר א messenger of faithfulness , trusty messenger Prov 13:17 ׳ עֵד א faithful witness Prov 14:5 compare ׳ אִישׁ א Prov 20:6 ׳ שֹׁמֵר א keeping faithfulness Isa 26:2 , perhaps also Ps 31:24 ׳ נצד א see I. [ אָמַן ].", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB531')\">BDB531</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H529')\">H529</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB530')\">BDB530</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB532')\">BDB532</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>אֵמֻן</bdbheb> <b>noun [masculine]</b> <highlightword>trusting, faithfulness</highlightword> (on formation compare <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Ges')\">Ges</lookup><sup>«GKC:84a»§ 84a</sup> R. 12). 1. <div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> <bdbheb>בָּנִים לֹא אֵמֻן בָּם</bdbheb> <highlight>children in whom there is no trusting</highlight> <ref ref=\"Deut 32:20\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"32\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"32\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(5,32,20)\">Deut 32:20</ref> (poetry) 2. <bdbheb>אֱמוּנִים</bdbheb> plural abstract <highlight>faithfulness</highlight>; <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>צִיר א</bdbheb> <highlight>messenger of faithfulness</highlight>, trusty messenger <ref ref=\"Prov 13:17\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(20,13,17)\">Prov 13:17</ref> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>עֵד א</bdbheb> <highlight>faithful witness</highlight> <ref ref=\"Prov 14:5\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(20,14,5)\">Prov 14:5</ref> compare <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>אִישׁ א</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Prov 20:6\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(20,20,6)\">Prov 20:6</ref> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>שֹׁמֵר א</bdbheb> <highlight>keeping faithfulness</highlight> <ref ref=\"Isa 26:2\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"26\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"26\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(23,26,2)\">Isa 26:2</ref>, perhaps also <ref ref=\"Ps 31:24\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"31\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"31\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(19,31,24)\">Ps 31:24</ref> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>נצד א</bdbheb> see I. [ <bdbheb><reflink>אָמַן</reflink></bdbheb>]. </p></div><hr>", "references": [{"raw": "Deut 32:20", "book": "DEU", "chapter": 32, "verse": 20}, {"raw": "Prov 13:17", "book": "PRO", "chapter": 13, "verse": 17}, {"raw": "Prov 14:5", "book": "PRO", "chapter": 14, "verse": 5}, {"raw": "Prov 20:6", "book": "PRO", "chapter": 20, "verse": 6}, {"raw": "Isa 26:2", "book": "ISA", "chapter": 26, "verse": 2}, {"raw": "Ps 31:24", "book": "PSA", "chapter": 31, "verse": 24}], "flagged": {"hebrew": ["אֵמֻן", "בָּנִים לֹא אֵמֻן בָּם", "אֱמוּנִים", "׳", "צִיר א", "עֵד א", "אִישׁ א", "שֹׁמֵר א", "נצד א", "אָמַן"], "aramaic": [], "greek": [], "translit": [], "abbreviations": ["Ges"]}, "covers": [], "bdbid": "BDB531", "source": "BDB", "testament": "OT"}